step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Evaluate a simple mean of the full model pool to establish a baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination using inverse error on the full pool to test if weighting improves over simple mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust central tendency by using the median of the full model pool to see if it beats the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if removing extreme predictions improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test the best single model FT_catboost to see if a single strong model beats the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"FT_catboost"}

Thought: Test a DBA (Dynamic Bayesian Aggregation) on the full pool to see if a more sophisticated algorithm beats the simple mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on a smaller, high‑performance pool to see if focusing on top models improves over the full‑pool mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test the best single model THETA to see if a single strong model beats the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"THETA"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if reducing model set improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle (w1) on the full pool to see if a more sophisticated weighting improves over the best single THETA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on a slightly larger but still stable pool (pool2) using inverse_error to see if adding FT_catboost improves over pool1 results.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination over the full pool using inverse_error weights to see if it can beat the best_single THETA.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool2 to see if a slightly larger but still stable pool improves over best_single THETA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool2"}

